  "question": "What Roman coins were found at Illerup Adal?",
  "answer": "The deposit at Illerup Ådal contained a substantial number of Roman coins alongside its other war-booty contents such as gold, silver, weapons, and tools [S3]. Specifically, the find included 194 Roman denarii [S3]. In addition to these, there were four barbarous imitations of Roman coinage [S3]. A single sestertius was also present in the deposit [S3].",
